# Cursor Rules — AI API Radar Release Gates

## Local Gates (Must Pass Before Push)
Run and confirm all pass:
```bash
git status
git log --oneline -3
git rev-parse HEAD
git ls-remote origin HEAD
npm run verify
npm run build
npm run check:release
```

## Sitemap / LLMs Gates
- sitemap.xml must contain homepage + all 28 content pages = 29 <loc>
- llms.txt must contain homepage + all 28 content pages = 29 page entries
- /404 must NOT appear in sitemap or llms.txt
- sitemap and llms must be regenerated after any pages.ts change

## Current URL Count (Source of Truth)
- Homepage: https://aiapiradar.com/ (1)
- Content pages: 28 slugs from pages.ts
- Total public URLs: 29
- 404 page: exists but excluded from sitemap/llms

## CTA Gates (Full-Site, Not Sample)
- All 29 public pages must include https://aiapidoctor.com/
- All 29 public pages must include https://api1.link-ai.cc/register
- Zero occurrences of #/register in any page
- Zero occurrences of /tools/ in any page
- CTA checks are never optional — must check all 29 pages

## SEO Gates
- All public pages: canonical = https://aiapiradar.com/[slug]/
- All public pages: no noindex meta tag
- Homepage: canonical = https://aiapiradar.com/
- Homepage: no noindex meta tag

## 404 Gates
- Invalid routes must return HTTP 404 (real 404, not homepage 200)
- 404 page must contain "页面未找到"
- 404 page must have `<meta name="robots" content="noindex, follow">`
- 404 page is excluded from sitemap and llms.txt

## www Redirect Gate
- https://www.aiapiradar.com/* must 301 to https://aiapiradar.com/[path]
- Path and query string must be preserved through redirect
- www domain must NOT return 200

## Cloudflare Commit Gate
- Cloudflare latest production commit MUST equal origin/main HEAD
- "auto-deploying" does NOT equal "deployed"
- Do not report production as updated until Cloudflare confirms deployment
- If Cloudflare is on an old commit, do not retry old deployment — push trigger or fix properly

## Forbidden Phrase Gate
- Zero true hits for any forbidden phrase (see 10-content-rules.mdc)
- Any forbidden hit must output: matched term + file/URL + 120-char context
- CSS-only occurrences of "100%" do not count as forbidden content

## GSC / Bing Submission Gate
- Only submit after ALL production live checks pass
- Only submit after Cloudflare latest production commit = origin/main
- Verify sitemap and llms are live (not cached) before submitting
